 "nl": [
  "dev-lab offers NTP (UDP 123) to every zone.",
  "admin must accept NTP (UDP 123) from dev-lab.",
  "Any zone may connect to ntp-servers over NTP (UDP 123).",
  "Hosts in dev-lab may reach engineering over RDP (TCP 3389) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "monitoring must accept SSH (TCP 22) and NTP (UDP 123) from guest-wifi.",
  "Hosts in library may reach monitoring over SMB (TCP 445) and SMTP (TCP 25) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "admin must accept SMB (TCP 445) and IMAP (TCP 143) from hr.",
  "nvr offers DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "Restrict nvr so that its only permitted destinations are hr on NTP (UDP 123); ntp-servers on HTTPS (TCP 443); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Allow hr to connect to ntp-servers using DNS over UDP 53 and HTTP (TCP 80) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "guest-wifi is isolated: it may only reach engineering on HTTPS (TCP 443); library on DNS over UDP 53, and nothing else.",
  "guest-wifi may use any UDP port towards ntp-servers, except SNMP (UDP 161), which must be blocked.",
  "Allow ops to connect to guest-wifi using MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "Apart from engineering on NTP (UDP 123), all traffic originating in hr must be dropped."
 ],
